{"content_hash": "09eda394dea66839", "version_id": 832, "article_id": 84, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "The Weeknd samples Faye Wong song in Hong Kong show", "title_zh": "The Weeknd香港开唱，采样王菲老歌", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8188417.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596633313465-1256feb1c6d9?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8d2Vla25kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM0OTIzMjJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Samuel Regan-Asante on Unsplash", "author": "Samuel Regan-Asante", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@reganography?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/black-wooden-shelf-with-books-5j7nQv-jaVM?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(73, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(111, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "5d19934133bc"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-01", "word_count": 164, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "The Weeknd used a Faye Wong song in his Hong Kong concert. The song is 33 years old. It made fans ask again: how famous is Faye Wong outside Asia?", "lead_zh": "The Weeknd在香港演唱会上用了一首王菲的歌。这首歌已经33年了。这也让歌迷再次讨论：王菲在亚洲之外到底有多红？", "preview": "On October 24, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong tour. He played a new song called \"Hong Kong\". It samples \"Seasonal Wind\", a Cantonese song F", "preview_zh": "10月24日，The Weeknd在香港巡演首场开唱。他唱了一首新歌《Hong Kong》，采样了王菲1993年的粤语歌《季候风》。她空灵的嗓音和他暗色的R&B风格融合在一起。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 815, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/84/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 60.65, "size_bytes": 364896, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 194, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0f54abb/content/data/versions/832.json", "paragraphs": ["On October 24, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong tour. He played a new song called \"Hong Kong\". It samples \"Seasonal Wind\", a Cantonese song Faye Wong released in 1993. Her soft voice mixes with his dark R&B sound.", "The Weeknd loves Hong Kong films from the late 1980s and early 1990s. He grew up in a diverse area of Toronto with a big Cantonese community. He also shared Faye Wong's albums online before.", "Faye Wong is not a big star in Europe or America. But she has real fans there. She sang the Final Fantasy VIII theme song in 1999. It reached number 9 in Japan and sold over 500,000 copies.", "Her 1994 film \"Chungking Express\" brought her global fame. Music critics still praise her albums. For many listeners, she brought dream pop and indie music to Chinese pop.", "The Weeknd's sample shows that 1990s Hong Kong pop still matters today. It also shows that fame is not only about charts and numbers."], "paragraphs_zh": ["10月24日，The Weeknd在香港巡演首场开唱。他唱了一首新歌《Hong Kong》，采样了王菲1993年的粤语歌《季候风》。她空灵的嗓音和他暗色的R&B风格融合在一起。", "The Weeknd很喜欢上世纪80年代末90年代初的香港电影。他在多伦多一个多元文化社区长大，那里有规模不小的粤语社群。他之前也在网上分享过王菲的专辑。", "王菲在欧美不是家喻户晓的明星，但她在那里有真正的歌迷。1999年她演唱了《最终幻想8》的主题曲，在日本公信榜排到第9位，销量超过50万张。", "1994年的电影《重庆森林》让她在全球走红。乐评人至今仍称赞她的专辑。在很多听众眼里，她把梦幻流行和独立音乐带进了华语流行。", "The Weeknd的这次采样说明，90年代的香港流行乐今天仍有影响。这也说明，名气不只看榜单和数字。"], "body": "On October 24, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong tour. He played a new song called \"Hong Kong\". It samples \"Seasonal Wind\", a Cantonese song Faye Wong released in 1993. Her soft voice mixes with his dark R&B sound.\n\nThe Weeknd loves Hong Kong films from the late 1980s and early 1990s. He grew up in a diverse area of Toronto with a big Cantonese community. He also shared Faye Wong's albums online before.\n\nFaye Wong is not a big star in Europe or America. But she has real fans there. She sang the Final Fantasy VIII theme song in 1999. It reached number 9 in Japan and sold over 500,000 copies.\n\nHer 1994 film \"Chungking Express\" brought her global fame. Music critics still praise her albums. For many listeners, she brought dream pop and indie music to Chinese pop.\n\nThe Weeknd's sample shows that 1990s Hong Kong pop still matters today. It also shows that fame is not only about charts and numbers.", "body_zh": "10月24日，The Weeknd在香港巡演首场开唱。他唱了一首新歌《Hong Kong》，采样了王菲1993年的粤语歌《季候风》。她空灵的嗓音和他暗色的R&B风格融合在一起。\n\nThe Weeknd很喜欢上世纪80年代末90年代初的香港电影。他在多伦多一个多元文化社区长大，那里有规模不小的粤语社群。他之前也在网上分享过王菲的专辑。\n\n王菲在欧美不是家喻户晓的明星，但她在那里有真正的歌迷。1999年她演唱了《最终幻想8》的主题曲，在日本公信榜排到第9位，销量超过50万张。\n\n1994年的电影《重庆森林》让她在全球走红。乐评人至今仍称赞她的专辑。在很多听众眼里，她把梦幻流行和独立音乐带进了华语流行。\n\nThe Weeknd的这次采样说明，90年代的香港流行乐今天仍有影响。这也说明，名气不只看榜单和数字。", "text": "On October 24, The Weeknd opened his Hong Kong tour. He played a new song called \"Hong Kong\". It samples \"Seasonal Wind\", a Cantonese song Faye Wong released in 1993. Her soft voice mixes with his dark R&B sound. The Weeknd loves Hong Kong films from the late 1980s and early 1990s. He grew up in a diverse area of Toronto with a big Cantonese community. He also shared Faye Wong's albums online before. Faye Wong is not a big star in Europe or America. But she has real fans there. She sang the Final Fantasy VIII theme song in 1999. It reached number 9 in Japan and sold over 500,000 copies. Her 1994 film \"Chungking Express\" brought her global fame. Music critics still praise her albums. For many listeners, she brought dream pop and indie music to Chinese pop. The Weeknd's sample shows that 1990s Hong Kong pop still matters today. It also shows that fame is not only about charts and numbers.", "vocab": [{"word": "sample", "pos": "verb", "zh": "采样", "note": "音乐里指取用别人歌曲的片段", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tour", "pos": "noun", "zh": "巡演", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "release", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发行", "note": "常用于歌曲、专辑、电影", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "community", "pos": "noun", "zh": "社区；社群", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "album", "pos": "noun", "zh": "专辑", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fame", "pos": "noun", "zh": "名气", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "critic", "pos": "noun", "zh": "评论家", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "chart", "pos": "noun", "zh": "排行榜", "note": "常用复数 charts", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T00:18:40.801393", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "October", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.75, "sm": 375, "em": 750, "cs": 3, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "24", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.55, "sm": 750, "em": 1550, "cs": 11, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 1.55, "e": 1.65, "sm": 1550, "em": 1649, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "The", "s": 1.65, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1650, "em": 1775, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Weeknd", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.125, "sm": 1775, "em": 2125, "cs": 19, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "opened", "s": 2.125, "e": 2.438, "sm": 2125, "em": 2437, "cs": 26, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "his", "s": 2.438, "e": 2.6, "sm": 2437, "em": 2600, "cs": 33, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Hong", "s": 2.6, "e": 2.875, "sm": 2600, "em": 2874, "cs": 37, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "Kong", "s": 2.875, "e": 3.15, "sm": 2875, "em": 3149, "cs": 42, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "tour", "s": 3.15, "e": 3.775, "sm": 3150, "em": 3775, "cs": 47, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": ".", "s": 3.775, "e": 3.9, "sm": 3775, "em": 3900, "cs": 51, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "He", "s": 3.9, "e": 4.025, "sm": 3900, "em": 4025, "cs": 53, "ce": 55, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "played", "s": 4.025, "e": 4.262, "sm": 4025, "em": 4262, "cs": 56, "ce": 62, "si": 1}, {"i": 14, "w": "a", "s": 4.263, "e": 4.325, "sm": 4262, "em": 4325, "cs": 63, "ce": 64, "si": 1}, {"i": 15, "w": "new", "s": 4.325, "e": 4.513, "sm": 4325, "em": 4512, "cs": 65, "ce": 68, "si": 1}, {"i": 16, "w": "song", "s": 4.513, "e": 4.85, "sm": 4512, "em": 4849, "cs": 